# Alice Hotel — Core

Monorepo: `alice.hotel.backend` (Spring Boot), `alice.hotel.fe.admin`, `alice.hotel.fe.client` (Vue 3).

Full standards: [STANDARDS.md](../../STANDARDS.md)

## Fixed conventions

- API JSON envelope: `{ code, message, data }` via backend `ApiResponse` / `ApiStatus`
- FE reads business payload from `response.data.data`
- Base path: `/api/v1`; session cookie auth; FE Axios `withCredentials: true`
- New admin APIs under `/a/...` using REST (see HotelRoomController); do not extend POST-heavy legacy style
- Do not invent new folder/layer patterns; follow existing feature slices
- Do not commit secrets, `.env` with real passwords, `node_modules`, or `*.war`

## Workflow

Feature → check STANDARDS → branch (`feature/` | `fix/` | `chore/`) → implement → PR checklist → merge → release checklist

## Definition of Done

- Correct layers / stores / envelope
- Lint/format (FE) or Gradle build (BE) OK when touched
- Smoke main path; PR has goal + test plan
